    { "id": "contractor-note", "page": "contractor", "x": 0, "y": -180, "w": 1000, "text": "Contractor · dense utility interface\nRow 1: hub screens (Today · Projects · Overview · Clients · Settings). Row 2: the sell loop (Estimate builder → Render studio → Selections → Change orders → Price book). Row 3: the run loop (Schedule → Crew · Photo log · Money). ★ Render studio is the signature — hotspots link estimate line items to zones on the render." },
    { "id": "client-note",     "page": "client",     "x": 0, "y": -180, "w": 1000, "text": "Client · spacious editorial portal\nRow 1: sell path (Home → Explore ★ → Proposal → Decisions → Approvals). Row 2: run path (Timeline → Progress ★ → Payments → Messages). No accounts, no installs — every link is a magic-link. ★ Explore is the signature — tap a zone on the render, scope and price rise. ★ Progress compares render to reality with the same before/after component." },
    { "id": "sub-note",        "page": "sub",        "x": 0, "y": -180, "w": 900,  "text": "Sub · three screens · magic-link · never logs in\nAssignment → Submit bid → Wrap up. Three screens is the whole product for them." },
    { "id": "system-note",     "page": "system",     "x": 0, "y": -180, "w": 900,  "text": "Foundry · design system\nBrand principles, palette, type, two density modes on one token set, hotspot signature spec, copy voice, naming decision. Working brand — swap it when ready." }
